</div>
<div id="tooltip-demographic-age-range" role="tooltip" class="!ml-12 absolute z-10 invisible inline-block px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-gray-900 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-custom opacity-0 tooltip max-w-sm">
  <h3>Describe your Gig</h3>
  <ol>
    <li>
      As your Gig storefront, your title is the most important place to include keywords that buyers would likely use to search for a service like yours.
    </li>
    <li>
